0602762330392,"x":0.03187131521974765,"y":0.525329952537908},{"confidence":0.5,"height":0.042314335060449015,"text":"5.2026年的市長選舉，就是個讓人民多聽到 SoR 無法黨的好機會。","width":0.6453488631161443,"x":0.03197673116727792,"y":0.5898100165257733},{"confidence":0.5,"height":0.04177545801139659,"text":"6.市長，固然沒有幫 SoR 立法的權力；","width":0.37063953352020296,"x":0.03197674479645852,"y":0.6527415138046073},{"confidence":0.5,"height":0.05025877153729319,"text":"7.市長，仍然擁有對 SoR 表態的權利。","width":0.3738405958719831,"x":0.03181034669468228,"y":0.7072702157259622},{"confidence":0.5,"height":0.04490500863557856,"text":"8. 事實上，每位市民，也都擁有用選票，對 SoR 表態的權利。","width":0.5958333450595881,"x":0.029166660595205982,"y":0.7685664945783924},{"confidence":0.3,"height":0.10907843858260968,"text":"*SOR無法黨","width":0.2549383949477666,"x":0.6901180109387111,"y":0.7940247473732313},{"confidence":0.3,"height":0.050086355785837644,"text":"9.先選2026，因為此時 SoR 真已無法等；","width":0.39098836732071024,"x":0.03197674642085354,"y":0.8324697761875927},{"confidence":0.5,"height":0.05223880695349603,"text":"10. 再選 2028，因為屆時 SoR 或已無法擋。","width":0.4083333450595881,"x":0.020833327286223217,"y":0.8805970143997783},{"confidence":0.5,"height":0.031484913537745296,"text":"FoR you, FoR me, FoRmosa.","width":0.2485465014015219,"x":0.6962209352534049,"y":0.908462866303624}],"tool_sha256":"3985c007dc2b776ead4aae1c0750f7781bc0e14d19212af7066c91ae9a0af7df"},"bulletin-63-000-p1-5":{"engine":"apple-vision-accurate","image_sha256":"a3458870fc3e06b9d9204320a8b576f02b6cdba9e90df81937216fe690595ff3","lines":[{"confidence":0.5,"height":0.04336043360433606,"text":"2026 紫薇聖人作台北市長：紫薇新民唐星明聖誕節出生聖人 相將玉兔明麗天 中华明国與亞太共同體","width":0.9909228441754918,"x":0.004538577836261045,"y":0.0027100270969252493},{"confidence":0.3,"height":0.04065040650406504,"text":"救世聖人 紫薇新民星明 EARTH對決 HEART 沉入白洋 美國共濟特務（1）毀滅台灣 AI缺電→火利工","width":0.9863842662632374,"x":0.007564294049420146,"y":0.0433604332655827},{"confidence":0.3,"height":0.04065040650406504,"text":"程岩漿發電 智慧台北 綠能台灣（2）橫征暴斂 脱北狂潮=都會結